## Полная инструкция: FFmpeg с H.264 + H.265 (Windows exe)

### Шаг 1: Установка пакетов

```
sudo apt update
sudo apt install mingw-w64 mingw-w64-tools cmake nasm yasm pkg-config
```

### Шаг 2: Скачай исходники FFmpeg

```
cd ~/my_project/ffmpeg
wget https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-7.1.tar.xz
tar -xf ffmpeg-7.1.tar.xz
cd ffmpeg-7.1
```

### Шаг 3: Собери libx264 для MinGW

```
cd ~/my_project/ffmpeg
git clone --depth 1 https://code.videolan.org/videolan/x264.git
cd x264
./configure \
    --host=x86_64-w64-mingw32 \
    --cross-prefix=x86_64-w64-mingw32- \
    --enable-static \
    --disable-cli \
    --disable-asm
make -j$(nproc)
sudo make install DESTDIR=/tmp/x264-install
sudo mkdir /usr/local/x86_64-w64-mingw32/
sudo cp -r /tmp/x264-install/usr/local/* /usr/local/x86_64-w64-mingw32/
```

### Шаг 4: Собери libx265 для MinGW

```
cd ~/my_project/ffmpeg
git clone https://github.com/videolan/x265.git
cd x265
git checkout Release_3.5
cmake \
    -DCMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Windows \
    -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc \
    -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=x86_64-w64-mingw32-g++ \
    -DCMAKE_RC_COMPILER=x86_64-w64-mingw32-windres \
    -DENABLE_SHARED=OFF \
    -DENABLE_CLI=OFF \
    -DENABLE_ASSEMBLY=OFF \
    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local/x86_64-w64-mingw32 \
    source
make -j$(nproc)
sudo make install
```

### Шаг 5: Собери FFmpeg


```
cd ~/my_project/ffmpeg/ffmpeg-7.1

export CROSS_PREFIX="x86_64-w64-mingw32-"
export PKG_CONFIG_PATH="/usr/local/x86_64-w64-mingw32/lib/pkgconfig"
export CFLAGS="-I/usr/local/x86_64-w64-mingw32/include"
export LDFLAGS="-L/usr/local/x86_64-w64-mingw32/lib"

./configure \
    --cross-prefix=${CROSS_PREFIX} \
    --pkg-config-flags="--static" \
    --prefix=/tmp/ffmpeg-win \
    --target-os=mingw32 \
    --arch=x86_64 \
    --enable-gpl \
    --enable-libx264 \
    --enable-libx265 \
    --enable-static \
    --disable-shared \
    --disable-doc \
    --disable-everything \
    --enable-decoder=h264 \
    --enable-decoder=hevc \
    --enable-encoder=libx264 \
    --enable-encoder=libx265 \
    --enable-parser=h264 \
    --enable-parser=hevc \
    --enable-muxer=mp4 \
    --enable-muxer=matroska \
    --enable-demuxer=avi \
    --enable-demuxer=matroska \
    --enable-demuxer=mov \
    --disable-network \
    --extra-cflags="-O2" \
    --extra-ldflags="-static"

make -j$(nproc)
```

### Шаг 6: Проверка exe

```
ls -la ~/my_project/ffmpeg/ffmpeg-7.1/ffmpeg.exe
```

### Шаг 7: Использование на Windows

#### Запись с H.264

```
ffmpeg.exe -f gdigrab -framerate 30 -i desktop -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -crf 0 -t 60 output.mp4
``

### Запись с H.265

```
ffmpeg.exe -f gdigrab -framerate 30 -i desktop -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:v libx265 -preset ultrafast -crf 0 -t 60 output.mp4
```

